  title: Built in a Day
  art: {fileID: 0}
  textDisplay: To accomodate their new pieces of art, potato infrastructure was built. Drive-in movie theaters, art galleries, museums, and maybe a house or two sprung up within hours. All this has made their population grow further, though it seems like they still have room to grow...
  choice1: Aren't they just plants to be eaten?
  choice2: This could be the birth of something great...
